+# Research notes: 14-page keyword batch (29 Sep 2026)
+
+Purpose: reusable research from the batch that produced the 14 pages listed below, so later pages on similar keywords can reuse the facts and sources instead of re-researching. Every figure carries a "verify before reuse" flag: dates and fees change, and many came from aggregator sites, not official pages. Re-check against the official portal before publishing.
+
+Pages built in this batch (blog unless noted):
+- /services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-guidance-after-10th/ (BOFU service page)
+- /blog/career-options/: career-options-after-12th, pcb-career-options, career-chart-after-12th, mba-career-options, engineering-career-options, bsc-career-options, ba-career-options, career-options-after-12th-humanities, career-options-in-commerce-without-maths
+- /blog/college-degrees/: certificate-courses-for-bcom-students, best-courses-for-bba-students, job-oriented-courses-for-ece-students
+- /blog/skills/career-development-skills
+
+## Research limits (read first)
+- Reddit was blocked by the fetch tool (SITE_BLOCKED) in every task. Quora, YouTube, X and upsc.gov.in were blocked by robots.txt. Careers360 Q&A pages returned navigation only.
+- Real student and parent questions therefore came from search-snippet question titles (mostly Careers360 Q&A, some Quora and YouTube titles), one Telegram post and one Blind thread. No comment bodies were read.
+- Facebook, Instagram and X were not reached.
+- The WebSearch budget (200 per session) ran out mid-batch; a session limit also interrupted work until 6am IST, so some second-round research was thin.
+- Official pages that failed or gave no data: cbse.gov.in and cbseacademic.nic.in (404), ICAI/ICSI/ICMAI eligibility pages, consortiumofnlus.ac.in CLAT page, admissions.nid.edu (certificate error), NCAHP site, BCI site, joinindianarmy.nic.in, iimcat.ac.in (403), AmbitionBox (several timeouts), Statista (paywall), NPTEL fee page, ESSCI sites.
+
+## Student and parent question themes seen (titles only)
+- After 10th: which stream pays fastest; ITI or 12th; parents said take Science; which school, forms, exams.
+- After 12th humanities: best fields with scope; if I change science to arts in 12th, will it get scope in graduation and jobs.
+- PCB: what to do without NEET; what if NEET is not qualified; MBBS alternatives.
+- BSc: which combination has more scope; what after BSc if not MSc; is BSc worthless; "why no value of a BSc degree in India".
+- BBA: which course along with BBA; certifications for a 1st-year BBA student.
+- BCom: Tally ERP 9 and GST after BCom; computer courses with BCom; SAP for BCom; best combination with BCom.
+- ECE: hardware vs software tracks; VLSI vs embedded.
+- Skills: "learn coding unless medicine, law" advice (Telegram); depth over breadth (Blind).
+
+## Exams, dates and eligibility (verify on official portals)
+- CBSE Class 10 2026: first exams 15-21 May 2026 per one page; a second board exam and its results were reported (result declared around 18 July 2026). CBSE 2026-27 curriculum for Classes 9-10 reported to make a third language mandatory and offer advanced maths/science options. Basic Maths students allowed Maths in Class 11 (relaxation reported). Sources were news sites, not cbse.gov.in.
+- NEET UG 2026: reported cancellation and re-exam on 21 June with results and MCC counselling later; over 22 lakh registrations (news). MBBS seat matrix 2026 reported as about 1,36,939 seats (Careers360) and a revised 13,636-seat item at one site; treat as unverified. Qualifying marks page on Careers360.
+- JEE Advanced 2026 results press release at jeeadv.ac.in; JoSAA 2026 seat matrix about 67,323 seats (PW Live); JEE Main 2027 Session 1 dates from Shiksha (secondary).
+- CUET UG 2026: held 11-31 May with re-tests 6-7 June; result 23 June 2026; over 15.68 lakh registered; max 5 subjects, 1,250 marks; DU uses CSAS. DU UG Bulletin 2026-27 (du.ac.in) accepts Accountancy/Book Keeping in place of Maths for B.Com (Hons), contradicting a competitor claim.
+- CUET PG 2026 (NTA bulletin, 157 subjects); NIMCET 2026 exam 6 June, 60% eligibility, about 1,300 seats; JAM 2026 held 15 Feb 2026, about 3,000 seats across 22 IITs (applications usually close in autumn); UGC NET June 2026 notice (75% rule for four-year degree applies to JRF and PhD only); CSIR NET June 2026 (Biotecnika).
+- GATE 2027 (IIT Madras, gate2027.iitm.ac.in): registration opened 2 Sep 2026, closes 5 Oct 2026 (12 Oct with late fee); exams 6, 7, 13, 14, 20, 21 Feb 2027; admit cards from 4 Jan 2027; results 19 Mar 2027; 30 papers, 3-year score validity; new Robotics and Automation paper; DigiLocker registration mandatory for Indian nationals.
+- CLAT 2027 (Careers360, unverified): exam 6 Dec 2026, 2-4 pm, offline; registration 3 Aug to 31 Oct 2026; UG eligibility 45% (40% SC/ST); fee Rs 4,000 (Rs 3,500 SC/ST/BPL); about 25 NLUs, 3,649+ UG seats; 120 questions, negative marking 0.25. Supreme Court reviewing Bar Council age cap (25 Sep 2026, Bar and Bench). Do not claim CLAT is run by the Bar Council of India (a competitor error).
+- CAT 2026: 29 Nov 2026 at IIM Indore; registration closed; 50% marks (45% reserved); final-year students eligible.
+- NID DAT 2027: registration 10 Sep to 30 Nov 2026, prelims 20 Dec 2026, B.Des open to any stream (PW). NIFT 2027 Stage 1 on 10 Jan 2027, form via NTA. UCEED (IIT Bombay) open to any stream; participating IITs Bombay, Delhi, Guwahati, Hyderabad and IIITDM Jabalpur.
+- IPMAT 2027: tentative dates and 60% Class 10/12 marks (Hitbullseye); IIM Indore confirmed the 2026 test on 4 May 2026 and IPM as a five-year integrated programme; about Rs 6 lakh a year for first three years (Cracku, secondary).
+- CA: direct entry to Intermediate for graduates reported at 55% (commerce) or 60% (others) by coaching sites; registration about Rs 18,000; CA Foundation pass rates 15-20% over the last three sittings (caexams.in). CS Executive open to any graduate, skipping CSEET, about Rs 23,900 registration plus Rs 1,500 per exam group (2026, secondary). CMA direct entry for eligible graduates; no fee stated. ICAI/ICSI/ICMAI pages gave no eligibility text.
+- CFA (cfainstitute.org): USD 3,520-4,570 for all three levels, about 300 study hours per level, 4,000 work hours over at least 36 months; no Class 12 maths condition listed.
+- NISM (nism.ac.in): over 35 exams, some SEBI-mandated, valid about 3 years, fees from Rs 0 to about Rs 3,000. Institute of Actuaries of India ACET page used for actuarial entry.
+- NDA (PW, NCA Academy) dates are aggregator-sourced; NCHM JEE 2026 brochure at nchm.gov.in; NCET/ITEP (NTA, NCTE); NCTE draft B.Ed rules and UGC four-year degree rule are proposed or reported, not final.
+- RBI Grade B 2026: BankersAdda said applications 29 Apr to 20 May 2026, Oliveboard said TBA; sources disagreed. SEBI Grade A 2026 via Testbook. SSC CGL 2026 vacancies revised from 12,256 to 10,731 (secondary). IBPS PO 2026 vacancies quoted as 7,365 vs 7,565.
+- ISRO ICRB recruitment pages (isro.gov.in/ICRB_Recruitment12/13.html, 9); ISRO SC needs BE/BTech at 65%. BEL trainee engineer 2026 via Adda247 (pay not stated as first-year).
+- UGC SWAYAM credit directive (July 2026) reported by Careers360 and Free Press Journal; SWAYAM content is free, proctored exam carries a fee (NPTEL exam Rs 1,000 per exam); AICTE internship portal free and gives Academic Bank of Credits credits. NPTEL has over 3,200 courses.
+- CGST Rule 83 and the GST practitioner exam (taxtmi, cleartax, gstcentre); GST exam fee not verified.
+
+## Labour market and salary data
+- PLFS 2025 annual report (PIB PRID 2246009): graduate unemployment about 11.2% vs 3.1% overall (Forbes India reading); youth unemployment 9.9%, urban 13.6%. Data for India gave 13% graduate vs 3.2% overall; figures conflict, so cite the source used.
+- India Skills Report 2026: employability 56.35% (Careers360, Hans India); 61% for science graduates (via Careers360 summary). WEF Future of Jobs 2025 for skill outlook. LinkedIn Skills on the Rise 2026 (news.linkedin.com). TeamLease EdTech survey on fresher hiring in 2026 and proof-of-work preference.
+- AICTE engineering data (ThePrint, Careers360): placement figure 47.7% covers 2019-20 to 2022-23; 30% unfilled seats covers 2019-20 to 2023-24. AISHE 2021-22 (PIB). ThePrint: humanities 29% of engineers-to-UPSC selections. PIB CSE 2025: 958 recommended; 9,37,876 applied; 5,76,793 appeared. Tele-MANAS (PIB) cited for student stress support. DGT: 13,888 ITIs.
+- Semiconductor: PIB Chips to Startup (7 Mar 2026): target 85,000 semiconductor design engineers over 10 years; 315 institutions with EDA access, 500 planned under ISM 2.0; tools from Synopsys, Cadence, Siemens, Renesas, Ansys, AMD; over 1.85 crore EDA tool-hours; fab and test at SCL Mohali. ISM notes: 29 Nov 2025 and 7 Feb 2026. Business Standard/People Matters: shortage of about 300,000 chip professionals by 2027.
+- Salaries (all secondary, wide ranges, label as such): AmbitionBox embedded engineer Rs 1.5-11.1 lakh (about 5.4k records; freshers Rs 1.0-9.4 lakh; Qualcomm about Rs 17-21.7 lakh); VLSI freshers Rs 2.7-13 lakh (401 records, July 2025). BBA fresher about Rs 2.5-5 LPA, analyst roles Rs 3.5-6.5 LPA (Naukri, BMU, CollegeVidya). Investment banker spread Rs 3-60 LPA vs Rs 6-18.3 LPA (Internshala, Career Launcher). NLSIU BA LLB median Rs 16 LPA, highest Rs 18 LPA (NIRF 2025 via Collegedunia; top-tier ceiling, not typical). PayScale India 2026 used for software engineer, data analyst, digital marketing manager, mechanical engineer, nurse, pharmacist, graphic designer, accountant (small samples; engineering sample 27 profiles). Instahyre product manager data (May 2026). Naukri JobSpeak Jan and May 2026. Competitor errors to avoid: "Marketing Coordinator Rs 25-40 lakh", DUET/JNUEE as current UG routes, uncited "74% of recruiters", "70% follow the path", "60% regret".
+- MBA: IIM placement 2026 (MBAUniverse, Cracku, Careers360); AICTE management enrolment 2022-23 (latest verified); NIRF 2022 placement data is pandemic-era; "50% of MBAs unplaced" unverified. NIRF 2025 management ranking at nirfindia.org. GMAC/BusinessBecause on AI and MBA jobs.
+- Certificates (India pricing mostly third-party): Google Data Analytics and Digital Marketing (Coursera, about 6 months at 10 hrs a week, under USD 300 total; about USD 20-49 a month; Google's own 75% outcome survey), Microsoft PL-300 (100-minute exam, annual renewal; India price about Rs 4,000-8,000 third-party), Tally Bookkeeper (Tally Education on Coursera).
+
+## Framing errors in competitor pages (reuse as differentiators)
+- Claiming B.Com (Hons) cannot be done without Maths (DU bulletin says otherwise); claiming CFA needs maths; salary tables that contradict each other; listing ISRO or IAS as BSc outcomes without eligibility gates (ISRO SC needs BE/BTech); "employers describe hard-to-find" claims without data; generic top-ten lists with no India context (career.io, Prosple, Indeed Singapore).
+
+## Sources by page topic (starting points)
+- After 10th: newsonair.gov.in and news.careers360.com (CBSE second exam); collegedekho AP POLYCET; dgt.gov.in; nios.ac.in; aicte-india.org; drishtiias.com (MoE coaching guidelines); educationforallinindia.com (dummy schools); weforum.org Future of Jobs 2025.
+- After 12th, chart, PCB, commerce, humanities: NTA NEET/CUET (cuet.nta.nic.in), jeeadv.ac.in, josaa.nic.in, ssc.gov.in, nift.ac.in, medicine.careers360.com seat-matrix and qualifying-marks pages, testbook and collegeadmission.in seat matrices, cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in (NEET result PDF, DU bulletin), law.careers360.com CLAT, iimidr.ac.in/ipm, uceed.iitb.ac.in, nchm.gov.in, Consortium of NLUs, icai.org FAQ.
+- Degrees (BSc, BA, MBA, engineering): jam2026.iitb.ac.in, exams.nta.nic.in/cuet-pg and /ncet, gate2026.iitg.ac.in, isro.gov.in ICRB pages, pib.gov.in (PLFS, AISHE), nirfindia.org, mbauniverse.com, cracku.in, careers360 news.
+- Courses and skills (BCom, BBA, ECE, career development): nism.ac.in, swayam.gov.in, nptel.ac.in, learn.microsoft.com PL-300, coursera.org, cfainstitute.org, gate2027.iitm.ac.in, pib.gov.in PRID=2236290 and PRID=2284941, ism.gov.in, nielit.gov.in, skillindiadigital.gov.in, internship.aicte-india.org, nsdcindia.org, news.linkedin.com/2026/Skills-on-the-rise-2026, ambitionbox.com embedded and VLSI salary pages.
+
+## Known gaps to close in future updates
+- Official confirmation of CLAT, NDA, NIFT 2027, IPMAT 2027 and CA/CS/CMA eligibility; NPTEL certification fee; ESSCI qualification packs; DRDO eligibility; Army MNS route; GST practitioner exam fee.
+- Real Reddit/Quora answer text on every topic above.
+- 390px mobile render checks (no Chromium in the build environment).
+- The humanities page skipped the formal uniqueness audit (category has 190+ posts); a 6-gram overlap check showed 0.7-2.0% overlap with the five nearest pages.
