+
+  <h2 id="lanes">The 3 lanes after a BA</h2>
+
+  <p>
+    Most guides give you a list of 15 jobs. That hides the real decision. Three structural choices sit under every list, and each asks something different from you. They are ordered by growth headroom, not by prestige: working with a skill layer can compound into consulting or freelance income, a second degree raises the ceiling only if the institute is strong, and exams cap out at fixed pay bands even when you win.
+  </p>
+
