+>
+  <p class="lead-para">
+    <strong>A career chart after 12th is a one-screen comparison of every route open to you, with the entry exam, the length, the first-year pay and the catch beside each one.</strong>
+    Use the chart below to shortlist three routes, then build a high-income skill portfolio on top of whichever one you pick, because that is what moves you toward stronger income opportunities and earlier financial freedom.
