+  </p>
+
+  <p>
+    If you are stuck between the rows, the <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance service</a> helps you build a shortlist and a skill plan you can actually finish. You can also start with the small <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/assessments/stream-selector-test-after-12th">stream selector test</a>.
+  </p>
