+      </div>
+    ))}
+  </div>
+
+  <p class="note-line">
+    Exam names, dates and eligibility change every cycle. Confirm each one on the official site (NTA, ICAI, the NLU consortium, UPSC or the college) before you plan around it.
+  </p>
+
+  <h2 id="full-chart">The full chart, row by row</h2>
+
+  <p>
+    Rows lead with routes that have the most room to grow with skill and ownership, and end with those whose pay bands are more fixed. The order is a judgement about headroom, not about prestige or exam difficulty.
+  </p>
+
+  <div class="table-wrap">
+    <table class="paths-table">
+      <thead>
