+    <p>That is why a written second route is not low ambition. It is how careful families protect a year and a large amount of money.</p>
+  </div>
+
+  <p>
+    For a deeper look at each science stream, read <a href="/blog/career-options/career-options-after-12th-science/">career options after 12th science</a>, <a href="/blog/career-options/pcm-career-options/">PCM career options</a>, <a href="/blog/career-options/career-options-after-12th-pcb/">career options after 12th PCB</a> and, if NEET is not the plan, <a href="/blog/career-options/pcb-career-options-without-neet/">PCB career options without NEET</a>.
+  </p>
+
