+
+  <p>
+    Marks pressure has eased a little. In 2026 CBSE ran a second Class 10 board exam in May, where the better of the two performances is used for the final result. According to the <a href="https://www.cbse.gov.in/cbsenew/documents/Press_Release_18072026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CBSE press release</a>, 5,13,955 candidates took an improvement attempt and 3,08,095 (59.95%) improved.
