+      </li>
+    ))}
+  </ol>
+
+  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
+    <p>The route you choose is a base layer. The high-income skill portfolio you build on top of it is what raises your ceiling.</p>
+    <p>For continuous, structured help building that portfolio, <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">get career guidance</a> rather than weighing exams, colleges and family opinions alone.</p>
+  </div>
