+    </p>
+    <p>
+      One scalable option sits inside several lanes: independent work. A skilled designer, analyst, accountant, or tutor can price by outcome, add repeat clients, and hire help over time. It scales because you own the pricing and the client list. It needs proof first, so treat it as a later step, not a first-year plan.
