+>
+  <p class="lead-para">
+    <strong>Engineering career options in India fall into seven lanes: software and IT, data and AI
+    roles, consulting or your own work, core engineering, an MBA, M.Tech or MS, and government and
+    PSU jobs.</strong> The lane that pays most on paper matters less than the one you can enter with
+    visible proof before your savings or your family's patience run out. A
+    <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong> built for one lane usually carries into the next, and
+    that is what opens high-income options and moves earlier financial freedom closer.
+  </p>
+
+  <div class="key-takeaways">
+    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
+    <ul>
+      <li>Pick a lane by the work you can repeat for years, the proof you can show, and your money runway, not by your branch label or a topper's video.</li>
+      <li>Growth headroom is highest where you own pricing or build depth: strong software, data and product roles, and consulting. Government and PSU jobs give stability with structured pay.</li>
+      <li>Some doors have dates. The GATE 2027 regular window closes on 5 October 2026, and the ESE 2027 application window closes on 6 October 2026.</li>
+      <li><strong>Choose two lanes, run one short, low-cost test in each, and let the result decide.</strong> One finished proof asset beats five unfinished certificates.</li>
+    </ul>
+  </div>
+
+  <p>
+    If you already know your branch, the guides for
+    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-after-mechanical-engineering-in-india/">mechanical</a>,
+    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-after-electrical-engineering-in-india/">electrical</a> and
+    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-after-civil-engineering-in-india/">civil</a> engineers go deep on
+    role-by-role detail. To decide where to go before you decide how, compare the lanes themselves first. More options across streams are in the
+    <a href="/blog/career-options/">career options section</a>.
+  </p>
+
+  <p>
+    Not sure which lane fits your situation and your family's money reality? A short
+    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
+    conversation can shortlist two lanes and set a first test, before you spend a year or a loan on
+    the wrong one.
+  </p>
+
