+
+  <h2 id="lanes-at-a-glance">Engineering career options: the seven lanes at a glance</h2>
+
+  <p>
+    Read this table across, not down. Each lane has a different entry gate, a different speed to first
+    pay, and a different ceiling. Nothing here is a ranking of good and bad. It is a map of trade-offs.
+  </p>
+
+  <div class="table-wrap">
+    <table class="paths-table">
+      <thead>
+        <tr>
+          <th>Lane</th>
+          <th>How you enter</th>
