+  </p>
+
+  <h2 id="what-next">What to do next</h2>
+
+  <p>
+    This week, choose two lanes from the table, write down the first test for each, and put the GATE
+    and ESE dates in your calendar if the government lane is on your list. Then finish one proof asset.
+    A stronger next move is often adjacent, not dramatic: it builds on the branch knowledge and work
+    you already have. If you want a second pair of eyes on your shortlist, your runway and the order of
+    steps, explore
+    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
+    built around a high-income skill portfolio and earlier financial freedom.
+  </p>
