+  </p>
+
+  <p>
+    There is also a supply side. AICTE data reported by Careers360 showed 4.23 lakh approved management seats and
+    about 2.85 lakh students enrolled in 2022-23, so roughly a third of approved seats sat empty. CAT 2025 had 2.95
+    lakh registrations and 2.58 lakh test takers. Far more people finish an MBA each year than the top institutes can seat, so a large
+    number of MBA holders compete for the mid-market lanes.
+  </p>
+
