+
+  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
+    <p>
+      <strong>Scalable ownership inside these lanes:</strong> an owned pharmacy, an independent physiotherapy or dental clinic, a nutrition or counselling practice, and a consulting or freelance health-data service all give you pricing control, the ability to hire and repeat local income that a fixed salary never offers. Each needs registration, credibility and a patient or client base, so treat it as a later stage, not a first-year plan.
