+    Certificates make the most sense <em>during</em> your BCom, while fees are small and time is free. If you have already
+    finished the degree and want CA, CMA, MBA, or other bigger routes, read
+    <a href="/blog/college-degrees/best-courses-after-bcom-for-high-salary/">best courses after BCom for high salary</a>.
+    For every path after graduation, see
+    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-after-bcom-in-india/">career after BCom in India</a>. Browse more
+    <a href="/blog/college-degrees/">college-degree guides</a> here too.
